<ProjectLayout slug="arena-waves">
  <p>
    When did a witch become a witch?<br />
Even before someone called her one,<br />
she must have already been there.
  </p>

  <p>
   People give names to what they cannot understand.<br />
Perhaps because once something has a name,<br />
it becomes a little less frightening.
  </p>

  <p>
    Across different lands,<br />
she was called by different names,<br />
and strangely, fire appeared again and again.
  </p>

  <p>
    Fire erased many things,<br />
but it could not burn everything.
  </p>

  <p>
    Some became smoke,<br />
some became stories,<br />
and some remained within the body.
  </p>

    <p>
   She remembers them,<br />
knows how to put them to sleep,<br />
and sometimes, how to wake them.
  </p>

    <p>
   What she is capable of<br />
is still unknown.
  </p>

    <p>
    Things that have outlived fire<br />
rarely reveal their secrets.
  </p>


